     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The bindings are in the bindings.js file found here <a href=\"https://github.com/jcheng5/d3-heatmap/blob/master/inst/www/binding.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jcheng5/d3-heatmap/blob/master/inst/www/binding.js&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792405734493000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0gnwbhOLKl3jtshS7r4sj4\">https://github.com/jcheng5/d3-heatmap/blob/master/inst/www/binding.js</a>.<div><br></div><div>You will see heatMapOutput adding this js file to the output.</div><div><br></div><div>The renderHeatMap function here <a href=\"https://github.com/jcheng5/d3-heatmap/blob/master/R/heatmap.R#L65\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jcheng5/d3-heatmap/blob/master/R/heatmap.R%23L65&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792405734493000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0WUOQcoKPuC2_Jz3IY7tLI\">https://github.com/jcheng5/d3-heatmap/blob/master/R/heatmap.R#L65</a> sends data to the binding, which is then processed and used to construct the heatmap.</div><div><br></div><div>I would recommend that you read this tutorial <a href=\"http://rstudio.github.io/shiny/tutorial/#building-outputs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rstudio.github.io/shiny/tutorial/%23building-outputs&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792405734493000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Tonnczn81tWmK6tEkG7Xd\">http://rstudio.github.io/shiny/tutorial/#building-outputs</a> on building outputs. It provides you with a detailed overview of the things you need to do to set up bindings.</div></div>"
